                  "heading": "Quick Overview"
                },
                "text": "The Aventro Grand SUV is the flagship, full-size SUV offering from Aventro Motors, combining power, technology, and sophistication. Available in Petrol, Diesel, Electric, and Hybrid, the Grand SUV is designed for families and enthusiasts who seek space, comfort, safety, and the latest automotive features."
